## Permissions for Endpoints

- **Use decorators** from [services/permissions](mdc:services/permissions/__init__.py):

```python
from services.permissions import require_permission, require_plan_access

@router.post("/generate-content")
@require_permission(action="generate_content", error_message="Permiso requerido")
async def generate_content(request: Request, plan_id: str):
    ...

@router.post("/{plan_id}/use")
@require_plan_access()
async def use_plan_resources(plan_id: str, request: Request):
    ...
```

- **Additional validators**: see [services/permissions/decorators/user_validators.py](mdc:services/permissions/decorators/user_validators.py).
- **Permission matrix and manager**: [services/permissions/models/permission_matrix.py](mdc:services/permissions/models/permission_matrix.py), [services/permissions/managers/permission_manager.py](mdc:services/permissions/managers/permission_manager.py)
- **Optional middleware**: [services/permissions/middleware/permission_middleware.py](mdc:services/permissions/middleware/permission_middleware.py) for global checks.
- **Docs**: [README](mdc:services/permissions/docs/README.md), [Integration Guide](mdc:services/permissions/docs/integration_guide.md), [Current Permissions](mdc:services/permissions/docs/current_permissions.md)

